silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_10_alternatives_dual_computational_sections_02_dual_construction_kernel_pair_concrete_anchor_4_Mammal#mammal silm:hasLongDescription "The Mammal is the inferred mammal class; f:Cat->Mammal. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mammal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
